  ;; Internal memory-u32 ABI; no dynamic Number semantics are changed.
  ;; Control words: bump cursor, lifetime epoch, error, live-object head. Objects: 32-byte
  ;; aligned header [kind, epoch, length, capacity, data, sealed, next, 0].
  ;; Error 1 handle, 2 capacity, 3 bounds, 4 UTF8, 5 UTF16, 6 sealed,
  ;; 7 epoch exhaustion. Public operations clear error before evaluating.
